case refusal_before_effects
kind negative
exec host-logic
domain 2
needs tasks launch test-authority
# refusals of the whole pipeline happen before any effect: nothing starts, no intent is written (ST7 steps 1 to 3)
cap C => OK
bind B cap=C => OK
bind N none => OK
bind X cap=C domain=3 => OK
launch P bind=B : cat ! foreign => UNAVAILABLE status=126 outcomes=FAILED_NO_EFFECT,FAILED_NO_EFFECT statuses=126,126
check empty
launch Q bind=N : exit 0 => DENIED status=126 outcomes=FAILED_NO_EFFECT statuses=126
check empty
launch S bind=X : exit 0 ! exit 0 => CAP_DOMAIN_MISMATCH status=126 outcomes=FAILED_NO_EFFECT,FAILED_NO_EFFECT statuses=126,126
check empty
